  ],
  "notes": "Study play. Our LD recovers behind the net and goes up the left wall to our LW. I'm the weak-side winger. Hold the right hash marks until the puck is on its way up the far wall, then leave for the middle lane at the blue line. The LW's second pass finds me in the middle with speed, and I carry it out and in. Their F2 on my wall is late because I left when the puck moved, not before.",
  "captions": [
    {
      "t_ms": 0,
      "text": "Our LD gets it behind the net. I leave for the middle right away."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 1500,
      "text": "Our LD passes up the far wall. Their LW is right next to me."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 2500,
      "text": "The middle lane is covered: their LW came with me."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 3000,
      "text": "Our LW is under pressure with nobody open and forces it to the middle."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 3600,
      "text": "Their LW steps in front of me and takes it. My wall is empty."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 4500,
      "text": "They come back at our net while I turn around. No breakout."
    }
  ]
